-close-q-wu-surrender"]},{"person":"luxun-p0077","role":"接受投降","evidence":["atlas-close-q-wu-surrender"]},{"person":"luxun-p0072","role":"撰写请降书","evidence":["major-proof-q-wu-letter"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0125","role":"提出并被采纳的计策","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0130","role":"奉书请命的对象，临近吴境","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0119","role":"奉书请命的对象，临近吴境","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0124","role":"奉使交付印绶请命","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":280,"precision":"year","label":"天纪四年三月（正文校记作三月壬寅）","chronology":"atlas-close-y280","evidence":["atlas-close-q-wu-year","atlas-close-q-wu-date","atlas-close-q-wu-surrender"],"dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"atlas-close-q-wu-year","basis":"四年春以下至降晋为同一年连续叙事，现代注释明示天纪四年为公元280。原文日期校记保留，不推算公历日。"}}}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0119","name":"王浑","evidence":["santizhu-q-799b648f266474b6c257","santizhu-q-1283bfd4d6765e17b41e","santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8","xuhuwang-q-b5ffd862487eb1d500d6","xuhuwang-q-e4cb95c98fc0f52113ef","xuhuwang-q-cf6d71623d6e66fa006a","zhangyan-q-b86fc7f04034d2681027","zhangyan-q-082f2bc2bca1364edb2a"],"facts":[{"id":"xuhuwang-f-f5600bd9e795f1546b6d","text":"字玄冲，王昶之子。","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-cf6d71623d6e66fa006a"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangyan-m-e8df8d79818e818ae9ed","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及王浑，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-082f2bc2bca1364edb2a"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-date","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-7e623d5c0070fc0c04d7","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：天纪四年（公元 280）。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":529,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ce3554cdfa6d4a10d8dc","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-letter","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-494ea68636e86f3566e3","layer":"original","quote":"而王濬顺流将至，司马伷、王浑皆临近境。皓用光禄勋薛莹、中书令胡冲等计〖7〗，分遣使，奉书于濬、伷、浑曰：“昔汉室失统，九州分裂；先人因时，略有江南；遂分阻山川，与魏乖隔。今大晋龙兴，德覆四海；暗劣偷安，未喻天命。至于今者，猥烦六军；衡盖路次〖8〗，远临江渚。举国震惶，假息漏刻〖9〗；敢缘天朝，含弘光大。谨遣私署太常张夔等〖10〗，奉所佩印绶，委质请命。惟垂信纳，以济元元〖11〗。”﹝三﹞","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":195,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-surrender","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c76b27d961ba7e5c15ed","layer":"original","quote":"（壬申）〔三月壬寅〕〖12〗，王濬最先到；于是受皓之降，解缚焚榇〖13〗，延请相见。﹝四﹞","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-year","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-6d9d569aba82d35ae0c8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，立中山、代等十一王〖2〗。大赦。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":520,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"major-proof-q-wu-letter","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"天纪四年，晋军征皓；皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-1283bfd4d6765e17b41e","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-45c0aa4ad8cd7d95dfdc","layer":"original","quote":"浑复斩丞相张悌、丹杨太守沈莹等","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":521,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-5e1ac8597c6e78a9cfc7","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c76b27d961ba7e5c15ed","layer":"original","quote":"（壬申）〔三月壬寅〕〖12〗，王濬最先到；于是受皓之降，解缚焚榇〖13〗，延请相见","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-799b648f266474b6c257","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-bd2df9b2ac026100f1ff","layer":"original","quote":"冬，晋命镇东大将军司马伷向涂中〖23〗；安东将军王浑、扬州刺史周浚向牛渚〖24〗；建威将军王戎向武昌〖25〗；平南将军胡奋向夏口〖26〗；镇南〔大〕将军杜预向江陵〖27〗；龙骧将军王濬、广武将军唐彬浮江东下〖28〗；太尉贾充为大都督〖29〗，量宜处要，尽军势之中〖30〗","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":477,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-494ea68636e86f3566e3","layer":"original","quote":"而王濬顺流将至，司马伷、王浑皆临近境。皓用光禄勋薛莹、中书令胡冲等计〖7〗，分遣使，奉书于濬、伷、浑曰：“昔汉室失统，九州分裂；先人因时，略有江南；遂分阻山川，与魏乖隔。今大晋龙兴，德覆四海；暗劣偷安，未喻天命。至于今者，猥烦六军；衡盖路次〖8〗，远临江渚。举国震惶，假息漏刻〖9〗；敢缘天朝，含弘光大。谨遣私署太常张夔等〖10〗，奉所佩印绶，委质请命","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":176,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-b5ffd862487eb1d500d6","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-28e9dcb373cc47d68073","layer":"original","quote":"子浑嗣，咸熙中为越骑校尉〖38〗。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-cf6d71623d6e66fa006a","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-da173e900b8924988577","layer":"original","quote":"其为兄子及子作名字，皆依谦实，以见其意：故兄子默字处静，沈字处道〖1〗；其子浑字玄冲〖2〗，深字道冲。遂书戒之曰〖3〗：","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-e4cb95c98fc0f52113ef","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-9efef78c08981bf4551a","layer":"pei","quote":"按《晋书》：“浑自越骑入晋，累居方任。平吴有功，封一子江陵侯。位至司徒。","attribution":"裴注·晋书及晋阳秋","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":253,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-125e9b12619f6916fa00","start":3,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-082f2bc2bca1364edb2a","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"是时法政多谬，举措烦苛；莹每上便宜〖20〗，陈缓刑简役，以济育百姓：事或施行。迁光禄勋。天纪四年，晋军征皓；皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-b86fc7f04034d2681027","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
